Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,===================== XXX =====================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.75,0:01:26.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是本田透
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.68,0:01:29.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去年的五月
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.55,0:01:32.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我媽媽因為交通意外過世
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.79,0:01:36.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我開始了秘密的帳篷生活
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.63,0:01:38.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在機緣巧合下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.10,0:01:44.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我開始到同班同學草摩由希同學家寄住
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.03,0:01:51.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 不管是由希、阿夾或紫吳
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.37,0:01:58.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,草摩家的人只要被異性抱到就會變成動物
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.65,0:02:00.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是個不可思議的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.18,0:02:07.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是件絕對不能告訴任何人的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.36,0:02:16.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們的活力來源是什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.80,0:02:18.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我活力的來源是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.10,0:02:26.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是在期中考結束那段時間才明了自己活力來源是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.45,0:02:34.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家聽好 全部科目裡面只要有一科考不及格
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.25,0:02:36.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就得在禮拜天來補考
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.42,0:02:38.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.35,0:02:39.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼不要
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.09,0:02:45.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們應該要感謝老師特地在假日給你們一個機會
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.43,0:02:52.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯 如果不喜歡補考 一開始就別考不及格啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.03,0:02:55.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透 你一定沒問題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.21,0:03:00.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有不及格？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.21,0:03:03.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幾科？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.61,0:03:09.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一科啊 那有什麼好難過的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.55,0:03:11.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊 小透
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.89,0:03:15.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比起全部不及格的我來說 你實在是幸福多了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.46,0:03:19.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你還是難過一點比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.53,0:03:22.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過小透居然會不及格 我還是第一次看到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.73,0:03:25.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道這次王子沒教你嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.67,0:03:28.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 他有教我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.34,0:03:31.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.31,0:03:36.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道你…要補考？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.95,0:03:42.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,實在是很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.95,0:03:45.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.45,0:03:50.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,由希你還特地教我 我卻還考不及格
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.69,0:03:53.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這實在是恩將仇報
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.76,0:03:56.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒有臉見你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.43,0:03:57.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.07,0:03:58.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.83,0:04:01.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要再自責了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.67,0:04:04.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰都會有狀況不好的時候啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.37,0:04:10.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,補考的題目會比較簡單
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.38,0:04:11.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定沒問題的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.88,0:04:14.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊 很輕鬆的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.82,0:04:17.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽到你這麼說 反而叫我擔心起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.99,0:04:20.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,草摩 時間差不多了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.79,0:04:22.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.36,0:04:26.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我今天要開學生會 沒辦法和你一起回家
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.40,0:04:30.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你別擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.77,0:04:32.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真丟臉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.31,0:04:44.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽說你要補考啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.38,0:04:53.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在幹嘛 我不管你羅
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.32,0:04:58.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好像越來越沮喪了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.33,0:05:00.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走起路來步履蹣跚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.26,0:05:03.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真是沒用
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.36,0:05:06.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像我這麼沒用 真能順利的從高中畢業
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.00,0:05:10.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完成當初和媽媽的約定嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.67,0:05:13.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我居然會不及格
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.78,0:05:17.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我突然覺得頭好暈
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.48,0:05:22.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣子 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.68,0:05:25.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.65,0:05:30.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼不能再堅強點…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.26,0:05:34.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你幹嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.30,0:05:37.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在幹嘛啦 不需要這麼難過的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.37,0:05:40.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真拿你沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.20,0:05:44.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這樣最後會發燒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.71,0:05:48.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.21,0:05:54.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發燒啊！我才剛說就發燒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.85,0:05:56.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.32,0:05:56.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真危險
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.88,0:05:58.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真危險 怎麼會這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.29,0:06:02.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發燒啊…真的發燒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.79,0:06:07.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,38度2
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.90,0:06:10.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透的病名是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.57,0:06:15.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感冒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.27,0:06:17.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這我知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.61,0:06:19.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點去睡覺啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.71,0:06:25.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關係 吃了藥就沒事了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.51,0:06:28.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還得去買晚餐的菜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.35,0:06:30.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別買了 快睡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.28,0:06:31.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對別人的感冒就那麼在意
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.15,0:06:34.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼自己感冒就毫不在乎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.92,0:06:38.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我今天還要打工
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.86,0:06:40.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翹一天班算了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.06,0:06:43.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.23,0:06:44.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透小透
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.63,0:06:47.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天什麼事都別做 安心休息吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.14,0:06:50.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了睡覺不能做其他事喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.74,0:06:52.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.74,0:06:55.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.41,0:06:57.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乖小孩要聽話喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.75,0:06:59.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.05,0:07:03.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 乖孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.42,0:07:09.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.76,0:07:13.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼偏在這種時候發燒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.36,0:07:17.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這不是更叫我丟臉嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.77,0:07:23.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 小透感冒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.11,0:07:26.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她沒事吧 有在休息嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.04,0:07:29.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紅葉 你太大聲了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.38,0:07:32.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是為了讓她好好休息 我才叫她別去打工的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.75,0:07:35.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以她今天不會去了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.05,0:07:39.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊 知道了 交給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.96,0:07:47.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天小透感冒請假一天
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.86,0:07:52.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我今天來替她做
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.23,0:07:55.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,連小透的份一起…我會賣力打掃的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.77,0:07:57.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他到底是哪裡來的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.11,0:08:00.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了 反正挺可愛的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.74,0:08:03.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無所謂了 這麼可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.82,0:08:10.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發燒時要怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.28,0:08:12.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感冒時要怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.69,0:08:15.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種時候就要吃韭菜…？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.59,0:08:18.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感冒吃韭菜最有效了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.00,0:08:23.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感冒時吃韭菜最棒了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.56,0:08:26.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,韭菜是治感冒的萬靈丹？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.33,0:08:27.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這也是韭菜 這也是韭菜
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.70,0:08:29.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這也是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.64,0:08:31.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 不看了 混帳
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.11,0:08:34.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每一本都只會說韭菜韭菜
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.88,0:08:39.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,韭菜根本不是人吃的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.89,0:08:52.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿夾 天氣放晴了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.91,0:09:49.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我燒到40度左右
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.22,0:09:54.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以希望截稿日期能夠延到下個禮拜
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.46,0:09:58.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼 老師 你這樣實在過分了點
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.43,0:10:04.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了 我頭好暈 又好冷 而且想吐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.07,0:10:07.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快死了～
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.74,0:10:10.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你沒事吧 老師…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.97,0:10:11.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.91,0:10:13.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老師～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.45,0:10:23.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.68,0:10:26.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？阿夾你在幹嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.49,0:10:28.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看了不就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.22,0:10:32.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,韭菜？難道是為了小透？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.86,0:10:36.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總不能叫病人自己煮飯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.91,0:10:47.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幹嘛 有疑問嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.41,0:10:49.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什麼都沒說啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.58,0:10:51.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 我們的晚餐呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.71,0:10:53.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然是叫外賣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.58,0:10:58.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有事拜託你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.39,0:11:00.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.75,0:11:02.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以幫我端給她嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.02,0:11:04.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.09,0:11:07.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我自己端！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.07,0:11:15.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弄壞家裡的東西要罰錢哦 罰錢 罰錢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.11,0:11:23.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扭扭捏捏的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.89,0:11:36.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請進
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.63,0:11:41.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼事？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.57,0:11:50.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿夾你特地幫我做的啊 好棒 我好高興
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.94,0:11:53.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別說了 你快吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.67,0:11:55.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 我要開動了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.92,0:12:03.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好吃喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.69,0:12:08.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃完的碗盤就放到走廊上
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.96,0:12:10.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.56,0:12:16.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 給你添麻煩了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.93,0:12:20.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然你會這麼想 就不要感冒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.40,0:12:23.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.07,0:12:27.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.88,0:12:30.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別哭喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.74,0:12:33.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對…對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.65,0:12:39.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幹嘛啦 說吧 有什麼心事就說出來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.32,0:12:48.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很想完成和媽媽的約定
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.53,0:12:51.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我卻考不及格 我真的很沒用
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.60,0:12:56.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不僅對不起由希
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.47,0:12:58.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至還感冒了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.54,0:13:03.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要成為更精明的人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.78,0:13:09.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說完了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.58,0:13:12.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說完了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.25,0:13:15.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算是考不及格也可以靠補考來挽回啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.79,0:13:19.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在意那個笨蛋由希干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.59,0:13:20.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,盡量指使他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.00,0:13:23.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓他做牛做馬都沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.33,0:13:28.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你真的覺得自己感冒很對不起大家
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.20,0:13:29.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就快點好起來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.70,0:13:33.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再像以前那樣成天傻笑地在家裡晃來晃去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.64,0:13:35.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,傻笑？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.64,0:13:38.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然我總覺得…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.99,0:13:51.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.36,0:13:55.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,覺得心煩氣燥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.43,0:14:00.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以在你可以晃來晃去之前
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.70,0:14:05.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會幫你做飯的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.51,0:14:08.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 你不要瞎操心了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.75,0:14:14.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.52,0:14:18.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 快吃 不然燒不會退喔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.65,0:14:19.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.22,0:14:22.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.72,0:14:25.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那種東西哪裡好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.59,0:14:29.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和你做的菜比起來根本…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.33,0:14:33.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個也就是說…是在鼓勵我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.28,0:14:45.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好高興
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.71,0:14:49.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你變精明了那才叫人難以忍受
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.35,0:14:52.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好高興喔 阿夾
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.30,0:15:04.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你回來啦 怎麼這麼晚
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.90,0:15:08.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.24,0:15:12.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,實在 實在太放肆了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.74,0:15:17.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和小透辛苦種的韭菜居然被…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.48,0:15:19.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是誰那麼過分
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.88,0:15:22.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是憎恨韭菜的人所做的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.39,0:15:31.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有人說是你 放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.70,0:15:39.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紫吳
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.80,0:15:44.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告訴你吧 真的要講起來 兇手就是小透
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.71,0:15:45.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.61,0:15:48.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過小透在回家途中因為發燒而昏倒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.88,0:15:50.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直在樓上躺著
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.64,0:15:51.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猜謎時間到了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.95,0:15:54.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請問 她到底是如何到你的菜園裡面
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.41,0:15:56.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偷摘你的韭菜呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.68,0:15:58.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發燒？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.69,0:16:06.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她剛吃完東西睡著 別吵醒她喔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.00,0:16:12.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你煮什麼給她吃？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.13,0:16:14.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,韭菜稀飯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.64,0:16:19.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想打架嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.15,0:16:27.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打架時請保持肅靜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.15,0:16:30.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然會吵醒小透的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.99,0:16:37.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我來晚了 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.36,0:16:44.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.10,0:16:49.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我聽說姊姊身體不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.70,0:16:52.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為看她快哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.41,0:16:53.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我帶她一起來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.71,0:16:57.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她知道你來看她一定會很高興的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.65,0:17:02.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.69,0:17:06.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透她沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.59,0:17:10.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全都來啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.29,0:17:12.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 先進來再說吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.60,0:17:19.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底要撐到何時 臭老鼠
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.10,0:17:22.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快把你的拳放下來 笨貓
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.81,0:17:28.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透 你覺得如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.58,0:17:31.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝 我好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.85,0:17:32.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小透
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.85,0:17:33.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姊姊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.22,0:17:38.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,病人躺著就好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.26,0:17:49.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 不能溫柔一點嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.20,0:17:53.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是嘛 小透是小女生耶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.97,0:17:56.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我那時候不一樣 你要溫柔一點喔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.00,0:17:59.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像捧著易碎品一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.71,0:18:02.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道他對你動粗過？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.71,0:18:04.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.95,0:18:08.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他給我打了好粗的針 簡直像給馬打的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.62,0:18:13.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一邊說打錯了 一邊一直用針戳我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.65,0:18:15.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還問我說痛不痛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.89,0:18:19.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別說了 孩子們會害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.73,0:18:21.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要打錯羅
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.00,0:18:24.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果小透喊痛就別打了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.87,0:18:30.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的 一點都不痛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.77,0:18:33.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是紫吳說會痛耶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.81,0:18:36.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是故意的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.24,0:18:38.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿波 你好過分哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.08,0:18:40.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然故意作弄人家
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.75,0:18:43.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰叫你要在那邊亂抱怨
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.19,0:18:49.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波鳥 醫藥費…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.49,0:18:52.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你還是快點好起來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.73,0:18:57.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你一直躺在床上 會有好幾個傢伙渾身不對勁
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.87,0:19:02.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有事就叫我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.17,0:19:09.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,連波鳥叔叔都不對勁吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.44,0:19:10.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒那種事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.65,0:19:14.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦！叔叔？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.48,0:19:20.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對哦 杞紗你12歲 波鳥先生他27歲
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.75,0:19:24.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,差15歲是該叫叔叔啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.42,0:19:27.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 那你怎麼叫紫吳和綾女
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.83,0:19:30.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紫吳叔叔 綾女叔叔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.87,0:19:34.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請進
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.04,0:19:38.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以進來嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.21,0:19:39.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.58,0:19:44.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波鳥說你應該差不多好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.58,0:19:47.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 抱歉讓你擔心了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.35,0:19:48.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.95,0:19:51.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先把這個給你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.25,0:19:52.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.02,0:19:56.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我幫你把補考可能會出的題目都整理出來了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.19,0:19:57.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.32,0:20:00.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要做熟了這些題目 我想補考一定沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.49,0:20:04.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等你好了之後再一起溫習吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.41,0:20:18.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.62,0:20:24.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是為了自己
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.56,0:20:32.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道除了韭菜沒其他的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.73,0:20:35.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幹嘛 在準備新娘課程啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.50,0:20:37.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.30,0:20:39.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是你…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.30,0:20:41.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了 是為了小透吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.37,0:20:45.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吵死了 小鬼到一邊去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.74,0:20:49.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！阿夾打人家
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.28,0:20:52.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吵死了 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.98,0:20:56.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是為了自己
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.38,0:21:00.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是希望能讓別人快點復原的這種心情
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.59,0:21:05.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波鳥 你想吃小透親手做的哪些料理？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.63,0:21:06.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.89,0:21:09.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞不好她會做點美食答謝你喔
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.53,0:21:15.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這不是很幸福嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.94,0:21:24.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的活力泉源都是大家給予我的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.22,0:21:31.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有 媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.72,0:21:36.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,關於補考的事 我總算順利及格了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.66,0:21:39.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 小花也是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.26,0:21:43.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,補考的題目要簡單多了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.13,0:21:48.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道你是故意考不及格的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.30,0:21:53.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們說呢 是不是呢？
